{
  "answer": "On a Light fare, you can bring your cat in the cabin, provided it meets the requirements: the combined weight of the pet and carrier must not exceed 8 kg, the carrier must not exceed 45 x 30 x 25 cm, and the pet must be at least 12 weeks old. A maximum of 3 pets are allowed per flight, with one carrier per passenger. The pet carrier counts as your cabin bag, so you can still bring your personal item. There is a fee of EUR 55 per flight for the pet. Note that pets are not accepted in the cabin on long-haul flights.",
  "policy_covers_question": true
}
